\0
The administrators of an extensive Imperium pure water extraction complex in the Kendrick system allowed Freedom Guard forces to take water from the compound in exchange for a share of the profits. By skimming only a moderate percentage of the facility's output, the scheme went unnoticed by Imperium auditors. However, the Imperium's mole in the Freedom Guard, Stiv Baator, leaked the conspiracy. The directors who had been bribed were abducted and executed, and the water complex was set upon by an Imperium armored division.
\1
Control of the water processing complex must be regained. Root out the Freedom Guard interlopers, but make sure the Water Extraction Compound is not destroyed. Freedom Guard forces may attempt to sabotage the facility once they realize they cannot hold the position.
\n\n
\cOBJECTIVES\n
\n
--> Eliminate the Freedom Guard base \n
--> Liberate the Water Extraction Compound
\2
Once again you have proven worthy of the challenges placed before you.\n
\n
\cHISTORICAL OUTCOME:\n
An Imperium fleet of newly developed Tachion Tanks overran the water processing complex and decimated the defending Freedom Guard forces. Retreating Freedom Guard troops attempted to sabotage the facility with a wave of suicide bombers, but without armor support the exposed infantry were cut to pieces. 
\3
That so much depends on you is unfortunate.

